.TH EASE_IN_QUAD 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
ease_in_quad \- Starts slow, speeds up (t squared)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqtween.h\(dq
.BI "float ease_in_quad(float t);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Starts slow, speeds up (t squared). Things that fall away or launch: a menu sliding off screen, a charge building.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the eased value.
.SH MODULE
tween (src/engine/tween/tween.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ease_out_quad (3),
.BR ease_in_out_quad (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
